# Step 3 — Create MongoDB Backup

Load password

```bash
read -s -p "Mongo root password: " MONGO_ROOT_PASS
echo
```

Create archive

```bash
docker exec -e MONGO_ROOT_PASS="$MONGO_ROOT_PASS" unifi-db sh -c \
'mongodump \
--host 127.0.0.1 \
--port 27017 \
--db unifi \
--username root \
--authenticationDatabase admin \
--password "$MONGO_ROOT_PASS" \
--archive=/tmp/unifi-prechange.archive \
--gzip'
```

Copy archive

```bash
docker cp unifi-db:/tmp/unifi-prechange.archive \
~/unifi-controller/unifi-prechange-$(date +%F-%H%M).archive
```

Verify

```bash
ls -lh ~/unifi-controller/*.archive
```

